OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mainly cloudy with
OL,6,Fsome showery outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fspreading east, the rain heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. A windy day with southerly
OL,9,Fgales likely across the Isles. A few
OL,10,Fbrighter interludes and a little
OL,11,Fwarmer.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy this evening with
OL,14,Fshowery rain dying out later. Then
OL,15,Ftonight some clear spells along with a
OL,16,Ffew showers, mainly in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
