OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny spells. There will also be
OL,7,Fa few showers, turning heavier in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Strong to gale southwest
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FFrequent showers on Tuesday with
OL,13,Fstrong to gale westerly winds. Showers
OL,14,Fdying out on Wednesday with some sunny
OL,15,Fspells developing. Rain spreading from
OL,16,Fwest on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
